# Per-Dockerfile override for the bank-app build. The repo-root
# `.dockerignore` is tuned for the JVM service images (which only
# need a pre-built uberjar) and explicitly excludes `bases/bank-app`
# and `infra/docker` — both of which the SPA build needs. Buildx
# picks up `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` ahead of the root one when
# present, so this file is consulted only for the bank-app target.

# Start by excluding everything, then whitelist the minimum the
# multi-stage build actually copies.
*

!bases/bank-app
!infra/docker/bank-app

# Re-exclude artefacts inside the whitelisted dirs. (Re-exclusion
# only works when the parent dir was re-included above.)
bases/bank-app/node_modules
bases/bank-app/dist
bases/bank-app/.svelte-kit
bases/bank-app/**/*.log
